From afe437eed2c380b92d3c4d303e78226777956012 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alan Tsai <alan-tsai@quantatw.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 10:49:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] i2c-vr: add support for TI TPS544X27 VR firmware update

The update image is a TI Fusion PMBus CSV script. The driver parses the
CSV commands, executes the supported PMBus write operations,
and then commits the configuration to NVM with STORE_USER_ALL.

Related PR:
entity manager
https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/93710
https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/93714

phosphor dbus interfaces
https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/93186

The corresponding change is under review in Gerrit [1].
[1] https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-bmc-code-mgmt/+/93438

Tested on rainiera6.
'''
1. Power off the host before update.

